.TH "ROTBYTE\-NOTIFY" "7" "2026\-07\-11" "rotbyte 1.3.0" "rotbyte Manual"
.SH NAME
rotbyte\-notify \- configure email notifications for rotbyte
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set up \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-notify email\f[R] to receive email health
reports after full re\-verifies and alerts when problems are found on
any scan.
This is a one\-time setup \(em once configured, notifications work
automatically.
.SS Quick start
.IP
.EX
rotbyte \-\-notify\-setup email
.EE
.PP
You\(cqll be prompted for: username, password, SMTP host, SMTP port,
recipient address (Send alerts to), and sender address (Send alerts
from).
The sender address defaults to your username \(em set it to an alias if
you want alerts to come from a different address.
A test email is sent at the end to confirm everything works.
Your credentials are saved to a local config file with restricted
permissions (0600).
.PP
\f[B]Config location:\f[R] \- macOS:
\f[CR]\(ti/Library/Application Support/rotbyte/notify.conf\f[R] \-
Linux: \f[CR]\(ti/.config/rotbyte/notify.conf\f[R]
.PP
