   *   *   *   *   *
.SS Usage
Once configured, add \f[CR]\-\-notify email\f[R] to any scan:
.IP
.EX
\f[I]# One\-off scan with notification\f[R]
rotbyte \-\-check \-\-notify email /Volumes/Media

\f[I]# Bake it into scheduled scans\f[R]
rotbyte \-\-track \-\-every 1h \-\-full\-at 2h \-\-notify email /Volumes/Media
.EE
.PP
   *   *   *   *   *
.SS What to expect
Full re\-verifies (\f[CR]\-\-check\f[R]) always send an email.
Quick scans only send when problems are found.
.PP
Each email has a subject line that reflects one of four outcomes:
.PP
.TS
tab(@);
lw(35.0n) lw(35.0n).
T{
Subject
T}@T{
Meaning
T}
_
T{
\f[CR]rotbyte ✓ /path \(em all files OK\f[R]
T}@T{
Full re\-verify completed clean \(em no bit rot, no missing files, no
read errors.
T}
T{
\f[CR]rotbyte ⚠ /path \(em N read errors\f[R]
T}@T{
Checksums clean, but N files could not be read.
May indicate a hardware issue or permission problem.
Re\-run \f[CR]\-\-check\f[R] to retry.
T}
T{
\f[CR]rotbyte ✗ /path \(em N failed, N missing\f[R]
T}@T{
Bit rot or missing files detected.
Email body lists the affected files.
T}
T{
\f[CR]rotbyte ⚠ /path \(em scan interrupted\f[R]
T}@T{
Full scan was cut short (Ctrl\-C or system signal).
Some files were not verified.
Re\-run \f[CR]\-\-check\f[R] to finish.
T}
.TE
.PP
The email body includes the affected file paths (for failures) or
guidance on next steps.
Run \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-report\f[R] at any time for the full database
view.
.SS Reconfiguring
Run \f[CR]\-\-notify\-setup email\f[R] again at any time to update your
credentials.
The config file is overwritten with the new values.
.SS Troubleshooting
\f[B]\(lqTesting connection\&...
failed.\(rq\f[R] \- Double\-check your app password \(em regular account
passwords won\(cqt work.
\- Make sure 2FA / two\-step verification is enabled on your account.
\- Verify you\(cqre using the correct SMTP host for your provider.
.PP
\f[B]Emails going to spam\f[R] \- Check your spam/junk folder after the
test email.
\- Add the sending address to your contacts.
.PP
\f[B]\(lqNo notification config found\(rq\f[R] \- Run
\f[CR]rotbyte \-\-notify\-setup email\f[R] to create the config file.
